    RUN --> HDR["quakedef68k.i / quakedefPPC.i<br/>glquakedef68k.i / glquakedefPPC.i"]
    HDR --> ASM68["68k .s: INCLUDE quakedef68k.i"]
    HDR --> ASMPPC["PPC .s: .include quakedefPPC.i"]
